0 41 653 [
[(This patch implements a simples scratch machine with [tabread4~], which reads audio samples out)]
[(of a floating-point array, often called a "sample table." The input is the index of the sample)]
[(to read. The output is calculated using 4-point cubic interpolation, which is adequate for most)]
[(purposes. Because of the interpolation scheme, [tabread4~]'s input cannot be less than one or)]
[(greater than the table length minus two.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
